{"title":"Career roadmap · Environmental Educator","role":"Environmental Educator","summary":"An Environmental Educator designs and delivers learning programmes that help students, communities, organisations and the public understand environmental issues, conservation, sustainability and climate change. The role can span schools, NGOs, museums, nature centres, conservation organisations, CSR programmes, government initiatives and environmental communication.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Environmental Studies / Ecology"},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Strong direct alignment"}],"intro":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"School teaching positions may require a recognised teacher-training qualification such as B.Ed., depending on the institution and applicable rules."}]}],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA Environmental Studies/Ecology","Environmental Education Internship","Education/Outreach Assistant","Environmental Educator","Senior Environmental Educator","Programme Coordinator","Environmental Education Manager","Head of Environmental Education / Sustainability Education Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build ecology, environmental science, climate, communication and teaching foundations."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in environmental education, conservation education, climate literacy, sustainability or outdoor education."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead environmental-learning programmes, teacher training, community campaigns and institutional partnerships."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress toward Environmental Education Manager, Programme Director, Sustainability Education Lead or independent environmental-learning consultant."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each yea